OL,3,GNEWSARepairable electronics being
OL,4,Awritten off - study
OL,5,
OL,6,FElectronic waste is being prioritised
OL,7,Ffor disposal rather than repair,
OL,8,Faccording to new research from the
OL,9,FUniversity of Surrey.
OL,11,FThe study found that only around 2% to
OL,12,F2.5% of devices at a municipal
OL,13,Frecycling centre were considered
OL,14,Fsuitable for reuse.
OL,16,FBy contrast, analysis of items taken to
OL,17,Frepair cafes showed that 50% were
OL,18,Fsuccessfully fixed, it added.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
