OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARepairable electronics being
OL,4,Awritten off - study
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Too many electrical products are
OL,7,Ftreated as waste before anyone has
OL,8,Fproperly considered whether they can be
OL,9,Frepaired, reused or stripped for
OL,10,Fvaluable parts," said the study's lead
OL,11,Fauthor Sheeba Pathak.
